  dominates at $approx 106$k CU, about $9 times$ an order. *(c)* Settlement
  revenue: prosumers capture $97.7%$ of gross value, wheeling the $2.3%$
  residual. *(d)* Energy conservation — traded energy (minted = settled = burned)
  and the separately certified RECs, both scaling with fleet size.],
  placement: top,
  scope: "parent",
  supplement: [Fig.],
